  "higher_law_duty": "Federal HAVA is referenced in new 24.2-643(E): 'This subsection shall apply in the case of any individual who is required by subparagraph (b) of 52 U.S.C. 21083 of the Help America Vote Act of 2002 to show identification the first time he votes in a federal election in the state.' The text does not say the bill itself carries out a HAVA duty.",
